{"start":"t:body","attrs":{}}
{"text":"\n      "}
{"start":"t:div","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n132.jpg"}}
{"text":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n132.jpg","n":"52"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/shemo"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"His Name is praised by the community of His portion, His praise is proclaimed by the holy Erelim and in His sanctuary everything utters glory of the Holy One. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/shomerei"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Those who observe His commandments will yet return to the fortress, those who fear Him, speak to one another in purity and bliss,  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"3","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/shomerei_14/chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"16","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/shomerei_14/chapter/16"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:malachi/3/16"}}
{"text":"and the Lord has listened and heard and it is inscribed in the book of remembrance,"}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"  the Holy One. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/shapru"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Improve your deeds that the covenant may not be broken, He who has adorned the skies, will hear your cry,  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"69","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/shapru_15/chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"32","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/shapru_15/chapter/32"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/69/32"}}
{"text":"and it will be more pleasing than the sacrifice of oxen to the Lord"}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"  the Holy One. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n134.jpg","n":"53"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/shivtei"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Let the tribes of those Thou hast called, arise and rule, cut off the branches of enemies and let them fall,  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"22","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/shivtei_16/chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"29","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/shivtei_16/chapter/29"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/22/29"}}
{"text":"for both kingdom and ruler belong to the Lord,"}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"  the Holy One. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/shevutenu"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"May our exiled ascend from afar His holy mountain that we may praise Him always in His Inner Sanctuary,  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"105","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/shevutenu_17/chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"42","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/shevutenu_17/chapter/42"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/105/42"}}
{"text":"for He has remembered His holy word,"}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"  the Holy One. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/kol_yoshvei"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"j:conditional","attrs":{"{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}id":"shemo_mefoarim_segment_14"}}
{"start":"j:all","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:fs","attrs":{"type":"opensiddur:rite"}}
{"start":"t:f","attrs":{"name":"metz"}}
{"start":"t:binary","attrs":{"value":"false"}}
{"end":"t:binary"}
{"end":"t:f"}
{"end":"t:fs"}
{"end":"j:all"}
{"end":"j:conditional"}
{"tail":"All inhabitants of the world and dwellers on earth do constantly say: Great things has the Lord performed on earth, "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"14","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/kol_yoshvei_23/chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"9","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/kol_yoshvei_23/chapter/9"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:zechariah/14/9"}}
{"text":"and the Lord shall be King over all the earth,"}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":" the Holy One. "}
{"start":"j:endConditional","attrs":{"target":"#shemo_mefoarim_segment_14"}}
{"end":"j:endConditional"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/adar"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Glorification and praise willingly do I bestow, I order prayer in speech and thought,  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"57","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/adar_1/chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"3","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/adar_1/chapter/3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/57/3"}}
{"text":"I call upon the supreme God."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"  On the day chosen from the mighty heavens for upright judgment to glorify His holiness,  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"97","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/adar_2/chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"1","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/adar_2/chapter/1"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/97/1"}}
{"text":"the Lord rules, the earth rejoices."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"  The world is too small to contain His loftiness, who is there able to describe His might?  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"47","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/adar_3/chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"8","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/adar_3/chapter/8"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/8"}}
{"text":"King of all the earth is God, then sing with understanding."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/dea"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"May all His creatures acquire perception and know how great is His might.  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"111","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/dea_4/chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"4","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/dea_4/chapter/4"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/111/4"}}
{"text":"A memorial has He established for His wonders."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"  He has firmly planted His foundation stone (Torah), the divine gift, so as to rejoice in His people.  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"105","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/dea_5/chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"8","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/dea_5/chapter/5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/105/8"}}
{"text":"He remembers His covenant for ever."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n136.jpg","n":"54"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/varasham"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He has inscribed my thoughts through a statute of the faith so as to remember me year by year,  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"6","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/varasham_18/chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"14","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/varasham_18/chapter/14"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:zechariah/6/14"}}
{"text":"for a remembrance in the sanctuary of the Lord."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/zevach"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"When the holy sacrifice (Isaac) once found favour in His eyes, He allowed a ram to be sacrificed in his stead,  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"22","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/zevach_19/chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"13","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/zevach_19/chapter/13"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:genesis/22/13"}}
{"text":"which was later caught with his horns in the thicket."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"  He taught the descendants of (Isaac) to blow the Shofar on this new moon; but if this day falls on a Sabbath,  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"23","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/zevach_20/chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"24","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/zevach_20/chapter/24"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:leviticus/23/24"}}
{"text":"then the mere mention of Teruah is a sacred proclamation."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"  When it falls on a weekday for you, let it be blown in all your regions,  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"29","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/zevach_21/chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"1","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/zevach_21/chapter/1"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/29/1"}}
{"text":"let it be a day of Teruah for you."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/yarum"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Exalted is the rock of my salvation in the mouths of all peoples. Expose Thine arm to help us against adversaries,  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"145","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/yarum_6/chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"13","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/yarum_6/chapter/13"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/145/13"}}
{"text":"Thy realm is a realm of all eternity."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"  When Thou revealest Thyself before all eyes to visit once again Thy dwelling place, congregations in their myriads will proclaim aloud:  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"15","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/yarum_7/chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"18","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/yarum_7/chapter/18"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:exodus/15/18"}}
{"text":"The Lord shall reign for ever and ever."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"  Becoming to Thee is honour and the acknowledgment of might pronounced by the earth and its inhabitants and all the isles:  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"10","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/yarum_8/chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"7","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/yarum_8/chapter/7"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:jeremiah/10/7"}}
{"text":"who does not fear Thee, King of the nations."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n138.jpg","n":"55"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/motot"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Break the yoke of adversaries, destroy them; gather those dispersed by Thee and redeem them without ransom.  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"74","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/motot_9/chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"2","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/motot_9/chapter/2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/74/2"}}
{"text":"Remember Thy congregation which Thou hast once chosen."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"  Comfort the noblest of peoples, expose to their faces the shame of those who rise against them;  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"137","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/motot_10/chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"7","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/motot_10/chapter/7"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/137/7"}}
{"text":"remember, O Lord, against the sons of Edom the day of Jerusalem."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"  Make even our highway, straighten it for our steps that the foot of Thy favourite may not stumble, as Thou hast said:  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"31","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/motot_22/chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"20","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shemo_mefoarim/quotations/motot_22/chapter/20"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
